<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>My Portfolio</title>
  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    body {
      background: #f4f4f9;
      color: #333;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    header {
      background: #222;
      color: #fff;
      padding: 20px 0;
      text-align: center;
    }

    header h1 {
      margin-bottom: 5px;
    }

    nav {
      margin-top: 10px;
    }

    nav a {
      color: #fff;
      text-decoration: none;
      margin: 0 15px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    section {
      padding: 40px 20px;
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: auto;
    }

    h2 {
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      text-align: center;
      color: #222;
    }

    .about, .projects, .contact {
      background: #fff;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    }

    .projects .project {
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 20px;
      background: #222;
      color: #fff;
      margin-top: 20px;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 10px 15px;
      background: #222;
      color: #fff;
      border-radius: 5px;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: 0.3s;
    }

    .btn:hover {
      background: #555;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>Chanchal</h1>
    <p>Web Developer | Designer | Programmer</p>
    <nav>
      <a href="#about">About</a>
      <a href="#projects">Projects</a>
      <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <section id="about" class="about">
    <h2>About Me</h2>
    <p>Hello! I’m John, a passionate web developer with a love for creating modern, user-friendly websites. 
    I specialize in HTML and CSS. I enjoy problem-solving and building creative solutions.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="projects" class="projects">
    <h2>Projects</h2>
    <div class="project">
      <h3>Portfolio Website</h3>
      <p>A personal portfolio website built with HTML and CSS. </p>
      <a href="#" class="btn">View Project</a>
    </div>
    <div class="project">
      <h3> my first project</h3>
      <a href="https://github.com/chanchal-oss/Form-by-using-Html-and-css-"> click here </a><br>
      <a href="#" class="btn">View Project</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="contact" class="contact">
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>If you’d like to get in touch, feel free to email me at:</p>
    <p><strong>chanchalsoni@example.com</strong></p>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <p>© 2025 chanchal | All Rights Reserved</p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>